# tools/repack.list — Omarchy packages reused on armv7h, one name per line
# (exactly as published in https://pkgs.omarchy.org/stable/aarch64/omarchy.db).
# See tools/repack-omarchy and docs/image/REPACK.md.
#
# arch = any     copied unchanged (with the upstream .sig);
# arch = aarch64 retagged as armv7h (omarchy, omarchy-settings: scripts, QML,
#                configs and themes only — the repack refuses any ELF file).
omarchy
omarchy-settings
omarchy-keyring
omarchy-themes-intros
omarchy-nvim
ttf-ia-writer
ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd-basic
yaru-icon-theme
tobi-try
ufw-docker
